    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03e944819d0dad29d803189f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过今日全力较量，令人有种预感，届时在\n“天皇赏（秋）”想必能见识到精彩场面吧。\n为了那一天，我们得先做好所有能做的准备。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdcce7bd9d298298553359c1a78d7968b13d04123f3c7bc1f3663a62cdd91406",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074313.json",
